---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro'
---

<Layout 
  title="HTML & CSS Cheat Sheet | Free Flexbox, Grid & Responsive Reference"
  description="Complete HTML and CSS cheat sheet with flexbox, grid, selectors, responsive design, and common patterns. Free reference for web developers."
>
  <section class="hero">
    <h1>HTML &amp; CSS<br><span>Cheat Sheet</span></h1>
    <p>Flexbox, grid, selectors, responsive design, and common patterns. From basics to advanced front-end.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>HTML Essentials</h2>
    <div class="formula-grid">
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Semantic Elements</h3>
        <pre><code>&lt;header&gt;   &lt;nav&gt;      &lt;main&gt;
&lt;article&gt;  &lt;section&gt;  &lt;aside&gt;
&lt;footer&gt;   &lt;figure&gt;   &lt;figcaption&gt;
&lt;details&gt;  &lt;summary&gt;  &lt;dialog&gt;</code></pre>
      </div>
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Forms &amp; Accessibility</h3>
        <pre><code>&lt;form action="/submit" method="POST"&gt;
  &lt;label for="email"&gt;Email&lt;/label&gt;
  &lt;input type="email" id="email"
         required aria-describedby="hint"&gt;
  &lt;button type="submit"&gt;Send&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/form&gt;</code></pre>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Flexbox</h2>
    <div class="formula-grid">
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Container Properties</h3>
        <pre><code>.container &#123;
  display&#58; flex;
  flex-direction&#58; row;    /* row | column */
  justify-content&#58; center;
  align-items&#58; center;
  flex-wrap&#58; wrap;
  gap&#58; 1rem;
&#125;</code></pre>
      </div>
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Item Properties</h3>
        <pre><code>.item &#123;
  flex&#58; 1;           /* grow equally */
  flex&#58; 0 0 200px;   /* fixed width */
  align-self&#58; flex-end;
  order&#58; -1;         /* first */
&#125;

/* Center anything */
.center &#123;
  display&#58; flex;
  justify-content&#58; center;
  align-items&#58; center;
  min-height&#58; 100vh;
&#125;</code></pre>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>CSS Grid</h2>
    <div class="formula-grid">
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Grid Layout</h3>
        <pre><code>.grid &#123;
  display&#58; grid;
  grid-template-columns&#58; repeat(3, 1fr);
  grid-template-rows&#58; auto 1fr auto;
  gap&#58; 1.5rem;
&#125;

/* Responsive grid */
auto-grid &#123;
  grid-template-columns&#58;
    repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
&#125;</code></pre>
      </div>
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Spanning &amp; Placement</h3>
        <pre><code>.span-2 &#123;
  grid-column&#58; span 2;
&#125;

.sidebar &#123;
  grid-column&#58; 1 / 3;
  grid-row&#58; 1 / -1;
&#125;</code></pre>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Selectors &amp; Specificity</h2>
    <div class="formula-grid">
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Selector Types</h3>
        <pre><code>.class &#123; &#125;          /* class */
#id &#123; &#125;             /* id */
div &gt; p &#123; &#125;        /* child */
p ~ p &#123; &#125;           /* sibling */
a&#58;hover &#123; &#125;         /* pseudo-class */
&#58;&#58;before &#123; &#125;        /* pseudo-element */
[data-type="x"] &#123; &#125; /* attribute */</code></pre>
      </div>
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Specificity Hierarchy</h3>
        <pre><code>/* Inline (1000) */
style="..."

/* ID (100) */
#header

/* Class/attr/pseudo (10) */
.nav-item&#58;hover

/* Element/pseudo (1) */
div p</code></pre>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Responsive Design</h2>
    <div class="formula-grid">
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Media Queries</h3>
        <pre><code>/* Mobile first */
@media (min-width&#58; 768px) &#123;
  .sidebar &#123; display&#58; block; &#125;
&#125;
@media (min-width&#58; 1024px) &#123;
  .content &#123; max-width&#58; 900px; &#125;
&#125;

/* Container queries */
@container (min-width&#58; 500px) &#123;
  .card &#123; flex-direction&#58; row; &#125;
&#125;</code></pre>
      </div>
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>CSS Variables &amp; Theming</h3>
        <pre><code>&#58;root &#123;
  --color-primary&#58; #3b82f6;
  --spacing&#58; 1rem;
  --radius&#58; 8px;
&#125;

.card &#123;
  background&#58; var(--color-primary);
  padding&#58; var(--spacing);
  border-radius&#58; var(--radius);
&#125;</code></pre>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Download</h2>
    <p>Print this page or save as PDF for quick reference.</p>
    <p><strong>Tip:</strong> Use Ctrl+P (Cmd+P on Mac) to print or save as PDF.</p>
  </section>
</Layout>
